  "content": "\n\n<h1>Tschipcraft 的優質火焰粒子</h1>\n<p>> 適用於 1.14.x-26.2.x 的資源包</p>\n<h2>功能</h2>\n<p><em>見證火焰舞動與閃爍時令人著迷的動畫。</em></p>\n<p>此資源包將火焰、靈魂火焰和銅焰粒子替換為動態版本。</p>\n<h2>預覽</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://tschipo.alwaysdata.net/assets/better-flame-particles/demo_scaled.gif\" alt=\"火焰粒子\"> <img src=\"https://tschipo.alwaysdata.net/assets/better-flame-particles/demo2_scaled.gif\" alt=\"靈魂火焰粒子\"> <img src=\"https://tschipo.alwaysdata.net/assets/better-flame-particles/demo3_scaled.gif\" alt=\"銅焰粒子\"></p>\n<h2>安裝方式</h2>\n<p>下載最新版本，將資源包的 .zip 檔案放入 <code>.minecraft/resourcepacks</code> 資料夾中，並在遊戲內啟用。</p>\n<h2>相容性</h2>\n<p>此資源包會覆蓋原本的火焰粒子。與其他非原版風格的資源包搭配使用時可能會顯得格格不入。\n<img src=\"https://tschipo.alwaysdata.net/assets/supported?untested_versions=26.3.x&supported_versions=1.14.x,1.15.x,1.16.x,1.17.x,1.18.x,1.19.x,1.20.x,1.21.x,26.1.x,26.2.x&total_versions=1.13.x,1.14.x,1.15.x,1.16.x,1.17.x,1.18.x,1.19.x,1.20.x,1.21.x,26.1.x,26.2.x,26.3.x&icons=true&platform=curseforge\" alt=\"支援的版本\"></p>\n<h2>外部連結</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbetter-flame-particles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://gistcdn.githack.com/Tschipcraft/452c07c3fc13361faa37e90d1262e4f7/raw/668cdb7776499728664beca45bd00227146f2b3f/modrinth-dark.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fbetter-flame-particles%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/images/layout/favicon-32.png\" alt=\"PlanetMinecraft\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fC0C5HEJB2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 上支持我\"></a></p>\n<h2>合作夥伴優惠</h2>\n<p>想要購買 <strong>Hytale</strong> 或升級您的版本嗎？結帳時使用創作者代碼 <code>Tschipcraft</code>，我將獲得抽成！（對您來說價格不變）</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d2611\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://tschipo.alwaysdata.net/assets/partner/sparked_banner.png\" alt=\"透過在 Sparked Host 購買伺服器來支持我（此為聯盟行銷連結）\"></a></p>",
